        "description": "Run the full test suite with coverage. Starts each TDD cycle.\n\nIf every test passes, the cycle moves to the red phase, where a failing\ntest must be written before production code can change.\n\nArgs:\n    location: Path to the project root.\n    language: The project's language, which decides how tests are run.\n",
        "input_schema": {
            "properties": {
                "language": {
                    "const": "python",
                    "default": "python",
                    "title": "Language",
                    "type": "string"
                },
                "location": {
                    "title": "Location",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            },
            "required": [
                "location"
            ],
            "title": "run_coverageArguments",
            "type": "object"
        },
        "name": "run_coverage",
        "output_schema": {
            "properties": {
                "result": {
                    "title": "Result",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            },
            "required": [
                "result"
            ],
            "title": "run_coverageOutput",
            "type": "object"
        }
    },
    {
        "description": "Create or overwrite a file, if the current TDD phase allows it, then run the tests.\n\nTest files may be written in the red and refactor phases; production\nfiles in the green and refactor phases. The test results decide the\nnext phase.\n\nArgs:\n    location: Path to the project root.\n    path: File path, relative to `location` (or absolute, inside it).\n    content: The complete new file content.\n",
        "input_schema": {
            "properties": {
                "content": {
                    "title": "Content",
                    "type": "string"
                },
                "location": {
                    "title": "Location",
                    "type": "string"
                },
                "path": {
                    "title": "Path",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            },
            "required": [
                "location",
                "path",
                "content"
            ],
            "title": "write_fileArguments",
            "type": "object"
        },
        "name": "write_file",
        "output_schema": {
            "properties": {
                "result": {
                    "title": "Result",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            },
            "required": [
                "result"
            ],
            "title": "write_fileOutput",
            "type": "object"
        }
    },
    {
        "description": "Replace exactly one occurrence of `old_string` in a file, if the TDD phase allows it.\n\nSame phase rules and test run as `write_file`.\n\nArgs:\n    location: Path to the project root.\n    path: File path, relative to `location` (or absolute, inside it).\n    old_string: Exact text to replace; must occur exactly once in the file.\n    new_string: Replacement text.\n",
        "input_schema": {
            "properties": {
                "location": {
                    "title": "Location",
                    "type": "string"
                },
